     "sub": {
      "en": "Complex V",
      "zh-Hant": "複合體 V"
     },
     "text": {
      "en": "F1 sits in the matrix and Fo in the inner membrane. Protons flow back through it from the intermembrane space, and the energy of this proton gradient drives the phosphorylation of ADP to ATP.",
      "zh-Hant": "F1 位於基質，Fo 位於內膜。質子由膜間腔經它流回基質，此質子梯度的能量驅動 ADP 磷酸化成 ATP。"
     },
     "cite": ["jonckheere-2012"]
